nal":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zsx2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"828ce39c-8743-4e69-b46d-448f1c1a6c87","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"コーヒーミルの粉受けずれてて悲惨な目に逢いました:cry:","ts":"1624853194.493800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"syobon","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]},{"name":"totemoturai","count":1,"users":["U06ECBRTJ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yIJY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae660ffe-4c80-4943-bc01-ce30473dd125","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"しかしまあ絵面がひどい","ts":"1624808621.492600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s3eqS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"FBA91B4B-E84F-4EEC-BBDA-4AC17199B7DA","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"\u003chttps://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%A9%BA%E9%A3%9B%E3%81%B6%E3%82%B9%E3%83%91%E3%82%B2%E3%83%83%E3%83%86%E3%82%A3%E3%83%BB%E3%83%A2%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC%E6%95%99|https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%A9%BA%E9%A3%9B%E3%81%B6%E3%82%B9%E3%83%91%E3%82%B2%E3%83%83%E3%83%86%E3%82%A3%E3%83%BB%E3%83%A2%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC%E6%95%99\u003e\nこれか","ts":"1624808580.492200","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: 空飛ぶスパゲッティ・モンスター教","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"空飛ぶスパゲッティ・モンスター教","title_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%A9%BA%E9%A3%9B%E3%81%B6%E3%82%B9%E3%83%91%E3%82%B2%E3%83%83%E3%83%86%E3%82%A3%E3%83%BB%E3%83%A2%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC%E6%95%99","text":"空飛ぶスパゲッティ・モンスター教（そらとぶスパゲッティ・モンスターきょう、英語: Pastafarianism, Flying Spaghetti Monsterism, FSMism）は、ボビー・ヘンダーソンが、「インテリジェント・デザイン説(ID説)」を公教育に持ち込むことを皮肉し批判するために創始したパロディ宗教(「インテリジェント・デザイン説(ID説)」についての詳細は当該項目を参照)。\n信者はパスタファリアン（Pastafarian）と呼ばれる。\n日本語の略称は「スパモン教（信者は「スパモン教徒」）」。\n2021年現在、日本を含む幾つかの国や地域に支部や信仰コミュニティを持つ。\nオーストリアにおいて宗教団体としての登録を申請したことがあるが、キリスト教ではないとして同国宗教当局より却下されている。その後、オランダでも宗教団体としての登録を申請し、こちらは2016年1月26日に認可された。","image_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/Touched_by_His_Noodly_Appendage_HD.jpg/1200px-Touched_by_His_Noodly_Appendage_HD.jpg","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%A9%BA%E9%A3%9B%E3%81%B6%E3%82%B9%E3%83%91%E3%82%B2%E3%83%83%E3%83%86%E3%82%A3%E3%83%BB%E3%83%A2%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC%E6%95%99","original_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%A9%BA%E9%A3%9B%E3%81%B6%E3%82%B9%E3%83%91%E3%82%B2%E3%83%83%E3%83%86%E3%82%A3%E3%83%BB%E3%83%A2%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC%E6%95%99"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hF=Gm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9f59d5b2-3c97-4277-a652-54802862f2ff","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"FSM教かな？","ts":"1624808451.492000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AJxL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6186205D-49C2-4745-BA01-7ECE69407299","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"天にまします我らの父よ\n願わくはラーメンを食べさせたまえ\nラーメン","ts":"1624808431.491700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"dajare","count":1,"users":["U01HFNMNB55"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YJn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C98F8506-B72A-46D9-B94A-83A1698DB3D6","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"ラーメン食べたい","ts":"1624808310.491200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bs="}]}]
